      <span class="tg-hero__type">Topical Study</span>
      <h1 class="tg-hero__title">Signs, Tongues, and the Marks of a True Believer</h1>
      <p class="tg-hero__intro">
        Does speaking in tongues prove a person has the Holy Spirit? Mark 16:17–18, the rest of the
        New Testament, the honest disagreements among Christians, and what Scripture actually gives
        as the marks of one who belongs to Christ.
      </p>
      <blockquote class="tg-hero__key-verse">
        <p>If you confess with your mouth, "Jesus is Lord," and believe in your heart that God raised Him from the dead, you will be saved.</p>
        <cite><a class="ref" data-ref="Romans 10:9">Romans 10:9</a> (BSB)</cite>
      </blockquote>
    </div>
